WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,010 --> 00:00:02,660
Boss Xia is here, right?

2
00:00:02,660 --> 00:00:04,900
Boss Xia asked you to come over to his back seat.

3
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:06,100
There is an extra large insulated box

4
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:07,980
There are definitely supplies inside. Go quickly.

5
00:00:07,980 --> 00:00:09,420
Don't keep Boss Xia waiting in a hurry

6
00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:11,300
Get out of the way, get out of the way

7
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:13,220
Captain Qihua, long time no see

8
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:14,540
How are you doing lately?

9
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:16,740
Xia Boss Xia, long time no see

10
00:00:16,740 --> 00:00:18,100
Captain Qihua

11
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:19,780
I brought something

12
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:21,460
It's not convenient to talk here

13
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:22,540
Let's change places

14
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:23,900
Let's go to my house

15
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:29,970
There must be supplies

16
