19
00:00:34,970 --> 00:00:35,970
Boss Xia

20
00:00:36,050 --> 00:00:37,840
This is my parents

21
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:39,720
Auntie, uncle, good parents

22
00:00:39,720 --> 00:00:40,920
This is Boss Xia

23
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:42,040
Good leadership Good leadership

24
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:44,400
Welcome leaders to come to my home to inspect my parents

25
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:45,720
Boss Xia and I need to talk about something

26
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:46,680
Don't come in and disturb me
